        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly is a musical rhythm game set in a space setting. Your main task is to complete each level without hitting any obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the pilot of a spaceship flying along a metal spline by the action of a magnetic cushion, which can rotate around the spline. Some obstacles are destructible. Such obstacles need to be smashed with a weapon or melted with a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is very beautiful and unique. Listen to the music and play in unison with it. The levels last an average of 3 minutes. Each of them has checkpoints that save the current progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly has a short story and a manual that describes all the functions and mechanics of the game (as the levels become more complex, new and/or more complex mechanics appear). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also purchase various coatings for your spaceship and more.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly is a musical rhythm game set in a space setting. Your main task is to complete each level without hitting any obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the pilot of a spaceship flying along a metal spline by the action of a magnetic cushion, which can rotate around the spline. Some obstacles are destructible. Such obstacles need to be smashed with a weapon or melted with a laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is very beautiful and unique. Listen to the music and play in unison with it. The levels last an average of 3 minutes. Each of them has checkpoints that save the current progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FastFly has a short story and a manual that describes all the functions and mechanics of the game (as the levels become more complex, new and/or more complex mechanics appear). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also purchase various coatings for your spaceship and more.</p>",
        "short_description": "FastFly is a musical rhythm game set in space. Avoid obstacles while moving and rotating around a spline. Some of them can be smashed into fragments or melted by lasers. The game has good interface and many game mechanics. Dive into the world of music!",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
